'''Top Dog (Merciless)''' is the second and final stage in [[NEO Wanwan's Glory]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Rugby Cat]], Gridiron Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

